      "path": "assets/voices/source_adv_voice_mygo_001_1_01_014.wav",
      "subtitle": "为什么？之前的演出不是很开心吗？\n你也说过还想再参加吧？"
    },
    {
      "slug": "soyo",
      "provider": "bdon.moe",
      "speaker": "soyo",
      "speakerId": "adv_soyo",
      "text": "是、这样吗……？\n可是，你是CRYCHIC的发起人啊？\n要是你退出的话……",
